uding an OE band below 1 near 4.5m, so no nonzero limiting ratio is claimed.","stage13_7_status":"ACTIVE_7C_COMPLETE_TO_B_5E6_FINITE","next":"Stage13-7d: analytic parity-resolved secondary-term/asymptotic model for the G-neutral OE/EE gaps, using the Stage12-style multiplicative/region machinery rather than extending finite counting blindly."}}
